Third-party data redistributed in this repository under their original terms:

  * sf_bay_public_evcs.csv — extracted from the U.S. Department of Energy's
    Alternative Fuels Data Center (AFDC, public domain, accessed June 2024).
    https://afdc.energy.gov/data_download

  * acs_tract_demographics.xlsx — aggregated from the U.S. Census Bureau's
    American Community Survey (ACS) 1-year estimates 2012-2022 (public
    domain). https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/acs

  * data/shapefiles/CA_County — California State GeoPortal (public domain).
    https://gis.data.ca.gov/datasets/8713ced9b78a4abb97dc130a691a8695_0

  * data/shapefiles/CA_Tract_BayArea — derived from TIGER/Line 2021 census
    tract shapefile (U.S. Census Bureau, public domain), subset to the six
    Bay Area counties (Alameda, Contra Costa, Marin, San Francisco, San
    Mateo, Santa Clara) used in the study.
    https://www.census.gov/geographies/mapping-files/time-series/geo/tiger-line-file.html
